OL,3,GNEWSABathing pools director seeks to
OL,4,Areassure swimmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sewage leak and wider concerns over
OL,7,Fwater quality have made for a
OL,8,Fchallenging period at Guernsey's
OL,9,FBathing Pools, its operators say.
OL,11,FThe Ladies' Pool was forced to close
OL,12,Fearlier this month after foul drainage
OL,13,Ffrom toilets reached the water, against
OL,14,Fa backdrop of separate concerns about
OL,15,Fsewage and water quality along the
OL,16,Fisland's east coast.
OL,18,FVive La Vallette operations director
OL,19,FHelen Bonner-Morgan said the situation
OL,20,Fhad caused disappointment, but
OL,21,Freassured swimmers measures were now in
OL,22,Fplace to prevent more drainage issues.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
