OL,3,GNEWSABathing pools director seeks to
OL,4,Areassure swimmers
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "For anyone who is still
OL,7,Fapprehensive about returning, we
OL,8,Fcompletely understand... people want to
OL,9,Ffeel confident that somewhere they swim
OL,10,Fis safe."
